<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>宿主预测 - 植物病毒分析平台</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="vp-lang" content="{{ lang }}">
<script>try{if(localStorage.getItem("vp_theme")==="dark")document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme","dark")}catch(e){}</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/app.css?v={{ asset_v }}">
</head>
<body>
{% include "_nav.html" %}

<div class="page">
  <div class="tools-layout group-layout">
    {% include "_group_nav.html" %}
    <main class="group-main">
  <div class="layout">
    <div class="col">
      <div class="card">
        <h1>🧲 宿主预测（ICTV 级联）</h1>
        <p class="hint">独立模块：对病毒 contigs 做 ICTV 宿主概率级联预测
        （Order / Family / Genus / Species 四级查表），结合 NCBI 宿主元数据与
        已知宿主交叉验证。输入 = 病毒 contig 分类表 TSV（自动识别列名）。</p>

        <label>病毒 contig 分类表 TSV（必选）</label>
        <div class="filerow">
          <input id="hp_tsv" type="text"
                 placeholder="管道③ virus_contigs.tsv 或 工具④ virus_classification.tsv">
          <button class="btn small" onclick="browse('hp_tsv')">📁</button>
          <button class="btn small" onclick="pasteSeq('hp_tsv', '.tsv')" title="粘贴 TSV">📋</button>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">管道样品在 <code>results/&lt;样品&gt;/03_assembly/virus_contigs.tsv</code>；
        专项工具④运行在 <code>tool_runs/contigs_*/virus_classification.tsv</code>。</p>

        <label>viral_contigs.fasta（可选，配套 contigs 序列）</label>
        <div class="filerow">
          <input id="hp_fa" type="text" placeholder="可选">
          <button class="btn small" onclick="browse('hp_fa')">📁</button>
          <button class="btn small" onclick="pasteSeq('hp_fa', '.fasta')" title="粘贴 FASTA">📋</button>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <div class="gp-item">
            <label>线程数（留空=自动）</label>
            <input id="hp_threads" type="number" min="1" placeholder="自动">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <button class="btn primary" onclick="runHostPredict(this)">▶ 运行宿主预测</button>
        </div>

        <div class="tool-out">
          <div class="tool-out-head">📤 输出</div>
          <div class="toolrun" id="toolrun-hostpredict"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">产物：host_prediction.tsv（逐 contig 预测宿主 + 置信度 + 方法）、
        summary.json。桑基 / 旭日图在样品报告（⑩）中展示。</p>
      <div class="rh" id="rh-hostpredict"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 文件/目录选择对话框 -->
<div id="dlgMask" class="dlgmask" style="display:none">
  <div class="dlg">
    <div class="dlghead"><b data-i18n="c.chooseFile">选择文件</b>
      <button class="btn small" onclick="closeDlg()">✕</button></div>
    <div id="dlgPath" class="dlgpath"></div>
    <div id="dlgList" class="dlglist"></div>
    <div id="dlgPickDir" style="display:none;padding:10px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line-100);text-align:right">
      <button class="btn small primary" onclick="pickDir()" data-i18n="c.pickDir">选择此目录 ✔</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script src="/static/i18n.js?v={{ asset_v }}"></script>
<script src="/static/app.js?v={{ asset_v }}"></script>
<script>
/* $ / esc / browse / startPolling / taskLogOpen 均来自 app.js */

function val(id) { return ($(id)?.value || '').trim(); }

async function runHostPredict(btn) {
  if (!val('hp_tsv')) { alert('请选择病毒 contig 分类表 TSV'); return; }
  const params = { tsv: val('hp_tsv'), fasta: val('hp_fa') };
  try {
    const r = await fetch('/api/tool/run', {
      method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
      body: JSON.stringify({ tool: 'hostpredict',
                             threads: +val('hp_threads') || null, params })});
    if (!r.ok) { alert('启动失败: ' + ((await r.json()).error || '')); return; }
    const d = await r.json();
    taskLogOpen.add(d.task);
    startPolling();
    $('tasks')?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'nearest' });
    watchTaskBtn(d.task, btn, '⏳ 预测中…');
  } catch (e) { alert('无法连接平台服务: ' + e); }
}

startPolling();
</script>
</body>
</html>
